    ((:file "src/dispatch.js"
      :issue "hard imports of Curator internals (lib/logbus.js, surface/card-api/, lib/canvasPower.js, lib/chipSink.js, etc.) that don't exist in motoi-scheme. File is NOT exported by src/index.js (see comment lines 112-120) but IS listed in package.json exports as './dispatch'. Any consumer that reaches for 'motoi-scheme/dispatch' will fail to load. Fix requires either (a) extracting the security-policy layer into a separate file that stays in Sakura, or (b) removing the package.json entry. Alfred should decide.")
